Async Alembic migration environment.

The database URL and target metadata come from app.core.config.settings and
app.models.Base — alembic.ini's sqlalchemy.url is intentionally blank.

Common commands (run from the project root):

  alembic revision --autogenerate -m "describe change"
  alembic upgrade head
  alembic downgrade -1
  alembic current
  alembic history

In Docker the api service runs `alembic upgrade head` on startup.
